{"id":"4da792c295e848bb","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-thm-supercompact-embed.md","title":"Supercompact Embedding Characterization","display":"thm-supercompact-embed — Supercompact Embedding Characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-supercompact-embed","aliases":["58-thm-supercompact-embed"],"display":"thm-supercompact-embed — Supercompact Embedding Characterization","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-thm-supercompact-embeddings.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-supercompact-embed"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-supercompact-embed</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-supercompact-embed — Supercompact Embedding Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e40b751ec8490f91\" href=\"?note=e40b751ec8490f91\" title=\"../batch11/58-thm-supercompact-embeddings.md\">../batch11/58-thm-supercompact-embeddings.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,j\">\\(M,j\\)</span> are class variables.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}\">\\(\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}\\)</span> is the metatheoretic class quantifier.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Supercompact}\">\\(\\operatorname{Supercompact}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> are the predicates used by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e40b751ec8490f91\" href=\"?note=e40b751ec8490f91\" title=\"../batch11/58-thm-supercompact-embeddings.md\">../batch11/58-thm-supercompact-embeddings.md</a>.</li>\n<li>Elementarity, transitivity, and class-function typing are expanded in the assertion rather than hidden behind undeclared class predicates.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^\\lambda\\subseteq M\">\\(M^\\lambda\\subseteq M\\)</span> abbreviates closure under all set functions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\lambda\\to M\">\\(f:\\lambda\\to M\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}supercompact\\text{-}embed}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Supercompact}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\n\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}M,j\\;\\Bigl[\n(\\forall x\\in M\\;\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in M))\n\\land j:V\\to M\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\\;\n\\forall\\vec a\\in V^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n\\bigl(V\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\n\\leftrightarrow M\\models\\varphi[j\\circ\\vec a]\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\n\\land j(\\kappa)&gt;\\lambda\n\\land M^\\lambda\\subseteq M\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}supercompact\\text{-}embed}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Supercompact}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\n\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}M,j\\;\\Bigl[\n(\\forall x\\in M\\;\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in M))\n\\land j:V\\to M\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\\;\n\\forall\\vec a\\in V^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n\\bigl(V\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\n\\leftrightarrow M\\models\\varphi[j\\circ\\vec a]\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\n\\land j(\\kappa)&gt;\\lambda\n\\land M^\\lambda\\subseteq M\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> are classes in the metatheory; the class map's elementarity and critical-point clauses are displayed directly.</li>\n<li>The closure clause quantifies over set functions of length <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>, not over a set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^\\lambda\">\\(M^\\lambda\\)</span> formed inside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-thm-supercompact-embeddings.md","status":"resolved","id":"e40b751ec8490f91","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-thm-supercompact-embeddings.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-thm-supercompact-embeddings.md","status":"resolved","id":"e40b751ec8490f91","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Supercompact}$ and $\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ are the predicates used by [[../batch11/58-thm-supercompact-embeddings.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"M,j","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Supercompact}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"M^\\lambda\\subseteq M","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\lambda\\to M","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}supercompact\\text{-}embed}\\vdash{}&\n\\operatorname{Supercompact}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\\\\n&{}\\to\n\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}M,j\\;\\Bigl[\n(\\forall x\\in M\\;\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in M))\n\\land j:V\\to M\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\\;\n\\forall\\vec a\\in V^{<\\omega}\\;\n\\bigl(V\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\n\\leftrightarrow M\\models\\varphi[j\\circ\\vec a]\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\n\\land j(\\kappa)>\\lambda\n\\land M^\\lambda\\subseteq M\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"M^\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1725,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4448","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-thm-supercompact-embed.md|58-thm-supercompact-embed]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["e40b751ec8490f91","65418b505fc53093"]}